  "finding": "Plate Montipora, Moon Aurelia, Planktonites and Wyvernal Sphinx direct Fusion paths now CompleteProcedure only after successful SpecialSummon. Eight original-effect/current-installed-metadata cases pass. Material-dependent native restriction causes four old original summons to fail yet old source actually revives never-summoned recipients; candidate blocks those revivals while preserving proper Fusion/revival. Omitted marker and disabled restriction controls each fail four cases. Moon original banished-from-GY trigger reached by actual neutral helper removal; Plate original GY banish cost; Planktonites actual required self-material payment from seeded field; Sphinx original Hand reveal/ignition.",
  "qualification": "Neutral recipient recipe/material-dependent restriction/revival probe. Existing explicit IsFaceupEx and empty mandatory-material mappings; Planktonites additionally reuses exactly-one forced-group-to-card helper mapping and starts seeded face-up, not original proper summon. Its known legacy Group/Card mismatch remains an original-runtime qualification. Delegated Chain Material paths unchanged/unverified; other printed clauses and live Omega remain open.",
